---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, contact } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={site.description}>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      David Theidel is a physicist working in quantum optics. He is currently a
      postdoctoral researcher at the Collège de France in Paris, in the Quantum
      Photonics team of Alexei Ourjoumtsev, where he works on Rydberg-assisted
      quantum engineering of light.
    </p>
    <p>
      He completed his PhD at the Institut Polytechnique de Paris in 2025, at
      the Laboratoire d’Optique Appliquée of the École polytechnique, on the
      quantum optical properties of high-harmonic generation in semiconductors.
      Before moving to France he studied physics at Leibniz University
      Hannover, working at the Institute of Quantum Optics.
    </p>
    <p>
      His research interests include non-classical states of light, photon
      statistics and higher-order correlations, collective light–matter
      interaction in strongly interacting atomic ensembles, and the use of
      these effects for quantum information.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Contact</h2>
    <ul class="contact">
      <li>{contact.email}</li>
      <li><a href={contact.scholar} rel="me noopener">Google Scholar</a></li>
      <li><a href={contact.orcid} rel="me noopener">ORCID</a></li>
      <li><a href={contact.github} rel="me noopener">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href={contact.linkedin} rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href={contact.bluesky} rel="me noopener">Bluesky</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .contact {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
